  "definition": "Treatment and Security Transfers",
  "effectiveDate": "2016-08-26",
  "historyNote": "#3178, eff 1-21-86; ss by #5483, eff 10-23-92, EXPIRED: 10-23-98 New. #6982, eff 4-22-99, EXPIRED: 4-22-07 New. #9192, eff 6-26-08; ss by #11168, eff 8-26-16",
